{
  "_comment": "Jinx Harness v2 — advanced MCP configuration. Copy to portable/mcp.json. Simple setups: just set JINX_MCP_SERVERS in portable/.env instead. Guide (فارسی): docs/MCP.md",
  "servers": [
    {
      "name": "example",
